{
  "title": "He initialization",
  "function": "he_init",
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "seed",
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "name": "fan_in",
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "name": "fan_out",
      "type": "int"
    }
  ],
  "returns": "mat",
  "library": true,
  "hints": [
    "The weight matrix has one row per neuron (fan_out rows) and one column per input (fan_in columns).",
    "Draw fan_out · fan_in normals with `random_normals`, multiply them all by √(2 / fan_in) with `vec_scale`, and fill the matrix row by row.",
    "return reshape(vec_scale(random_normals(seed, fan_in * fan_out), sqrt(2 / fan_in)), fan_out, fan_in)"
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "args": [
        2463534242,
        2,
        3
      ],
      "description": "a layer with 2 inputs and 3 neurons",
      "expected": [
        [
          -1.6455093556075222,
          -0.924431987362357
        ],
        [
          -1.185461226979586,
          0.24522960848372194
        ],
        [
          0.5339555220365974,
          0.3253895190487504
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "args": [
        42,
        4,
        1
      ],
      "description": "one neuron with 4 inputs",
      "expected": [
        [
          -1.301394093406596,
          -2.0595816113600436,
          0.8668482061707552,
          -1.2029904178430488
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "args": [
        12345,
        3,
        2
      ],
      "description": "3 inputs, 2 neurons",
      "hidden": true,
      "expected": [
        [
          -0.4587606408919655,
          0.35505459474697443,
          -0.7206673068634138
        ],
        [
          0.20792213196141476,
          0.14072321208068025,
          -1.537402536698961
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "args": [
        7,
        1,
        1
      ],
      "description": "a single weight",
      "hidden": true,
      "expected": [
        [
          4.294382204826231
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "args": [
        0,
        2,
        2
      ],
      "description": "seed 0 must still be rejected",
      "expect_error": true,
      "hidden": true
    }
  ]
}
